## 8. API Endpoints

### Auth Routes — `/api/v1/auth`

| Method | Endpoint | Access | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `POST` | `/register` | Public | Register as customer or seller |
| `POST` | `/login` | Public | Login for all roles |
| `POST` | `/logout` | Protected | Clear auth cookie |
| `GET` | `/me` | Protected | Get current user profile |

### User Management Routes — `/api/v1/admin/users`

| Method | Endpoint | Access | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `GET` | `/` | Admin | Get all users |
| `GET` | `/:id` | Admin | Get a specific user |
| `PATCH` | `/:id/status` | Admin | Activate/deactivate a user (`isActive`) |

> [!NOTE]
> All further resource routes (shops, products, reservations) are Phase 2+. Only Auth and basic Admin User Management go in Phase 1.

