## 12. Security Considerations

| Concern | Mitigation |
| :--- | :--- |
| XSS token theft | JWT stored in `HttpOnly` cookie |
| CSRF attacks | `sameSite: 'strict'` cookie flag; same-origin frontend |
| Password exposure | `select: false` on password field; never return in responses |
| User enumeration | Same `401` message for "not found" and "wrong password" |
| Brute force | Out of scope for Phase 1; can add `express-rate-limit` later |
| Plain-text passwords | bcrypt pre-save hook; never stored plain |
| JWT tampering | `jwt.verify` with secret; invalid tokens → 401 |
| Sensitive env vars | `JWT_SECRET` in `.env`, gitignored |
| Admin self-registration | `role: 'admin'` is not accepted in register endpoint |

