## Key Architecture Decisions Summary

| Decision | Rationale |
| :--- | :--- |
| Single User collection | Avoids duplicate auth logic; role field is clean and queryable |
| HttpOnly cookies | Eliminates XSS token theft; no CORS token header management |
| `select: false` on password | Defence-in-depth; password never leaks accidentally |
| DB re-fetch in `protect` | Enables immediate access revocation without token blacklist |
| `asyncHandler` utility | Eliminates repetitive `try/catch` in every controller |
| `validators/` directory | Clean separation; validation rules don't pollute routes or controllers |
| No Redis / no refresh tokens | Out of scope; 7-day JWT is acceptable for a startup MERN app |
